<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:f0c8ce7a88f6f983ea0760ea20560928864022aa230095206f52c93d70ec2071> <https://example.org/slice/text> "4. The lagoon is warm to the depth of an arm, and it keeps the colour\nof weak tea until the afternoon wind turns it the colour of slate." .
