<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:5a190b432c20c62e2022ee3befc5c134801a3217737e7306ac44a5d341ddd7dc> <https://example.org/slice/section> <https://example.org/slice/section:sha256:e0e3f6fc4e6b39f3d384bb2fab80195d01b28881cb0cb8dbb5c379ba0f0ee182> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:5a190b432c20c62e2022ee3befc5c134801a3217737e7306ac44a5d341ddd7dc> <https://example.org/slice/text> "5. The shell middens on the south bar are older than the landing, and\nno survey has counted them; the café on the quay sells the smaller ones\nto visitors, which is one reason the count keeps falling every season." .
