<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:b891888c22d58b0c300b01e1f9eb4f73009970feeb0f73641a33e73c840b6320> <https://example.org/slice/section> <https://example.org/slice/section:sha256:3edfe05f5f5d6e985f28199cca82e91852ce7b5e00c711ed389ad1f893658964> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:b891888c22d58b0c300b01e1f9eb4f73009970feeb0f73641a33e73c840b6320> <https://example.org/slice/text> "The salt pans open west of the lagoon and dry white by midsummer. Walk\nthem at first light, when the crust still carries a person, and mark\nthe pans you cross so the next surveyor can retrace the same ground.\nA bed worth a second visit carries a 🐚 in the margin of the sheet." .
